### =====================================================================
### TOEIC Scoring Engine – REST Client Test (VS Code)
### Cài extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client) rồi click "Send Request"
### =====================================================================

### ─── CÁC BIẾN (đã điền sẵn) ──────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl   = http://localhost:8080/api
@userId    = cmnw03aaq0000dr4sxbtcr0fa
@testId    = cmnwz1wgv0001i65g8eqprapo

### Sau bước 1, copy "id" từ response rồi điền vào đây:
# <ĐIỀN_ATTEMPT_ID_TỪ_BƯỚC_1>
@attemptId =cmnwz2j6e0001i670q3ystxcp

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 1 – Bắt đầu bài thi
### Nhấn "Send Request". Copy "id" từ response → điền @attemptId ở trên
### =====================================================================

# @name step1_start
POST {{baseUrl}}/attempts/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "mockTestId": "{{testId}}"
}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 2 – Xem cấu trúc bài thi (tham khảo questionId / choiceId)
### =====================================================================

# @name step2_snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 3A – Trả lời Q1 ĐÚNG (Listening)
### Q1: "What is happening in the picture?"
### ✅ Chọn A → "A man is opening a box." (đáp án đúng)
### =====================================================================

# @name step3a_q1_correct
PUT {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "cmnwysbdf0004i6pcppj1cgls",
  "choiceId":   "cmnwysbdf0005i6pcnxhg9udm"
}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 3B – Trả lời Q2 SAI (Listening)
### Q2: "Where most likely are the speakers?"
### ❌ Chọn A → "At a library" (đúng là B. At a train station)
### =====================================================================

# @name step3b_q2_wrong
PUT {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "cmnwysbdf0009i6pcux4zxi4d",
  "choiceId":   "cmnwysbdf000ai6pcpu7nqgsy"
}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 3C – Trả lời Q101 ĐÚNG (Reading)
### Q101: "Please submit the report ____ Friday."
### ✅ Chọn C → "by" (đáp án đúng)
### =====================================================================

# @name step3c_q101_correct
PUT {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "cmnwysbdf000gi6pcjf82ytmv",
  "choiceId":   "cmnwysbdf000ji6pc2eq7006p"
}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 3D – Bỏ trống Q102 (Reading)
### Q102: "The manager asked the team to work more ____."
### ⬜ choiceId = null → bỏ trống
### =====================================================================

# @name step3d_q102_blank
PUT {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "cmnwysbdf000li6pcigs4mwom",
  "choiceId":   null
}

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 4 – Nộp bài
### Kết quả mong đợi:
###   correctCount=2  wrongCount=1  blankCount=1
###   listeningRaw=1  readingRaw=1
###   listeningBlank=0  readingBlank=1
###   listeningScaled=10  readingScaled=8  totalScore=18
### =====================================================================

# @name step4_submit
POST {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit

###

### =====================================================================
### BƯỚC 5 – Xem lại kết quả (gọi bao nhiêu lần cũng được)
### =====================================================================

# @name step5_result
GET {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/result

###

### =====================================================================
### KỊCH BẢN B – Tất cả đúng (chạy lại từ BƯỚC 1 để lấy attemptId mới)
### Kết quả mong đợi: listeningRaw=2, readingRaw=2, totalScore=220
### =====================================================================

# PUT {{baseUrl}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "questionId": "cmnwysbdf0004i6pcppj1cgls", "choiceId": "cmnwysbdf0005i6pcnxhg9udm" }

